# Cloudflare Pages / Workers 静态资源响应头
# 规则：同名头只在一条规则里出现一次，路径必须互不重叠，
# 否则 Cloudflare Pages 会把多个命中的同名头拼成 "a, a"。

# 关键：Cloudflare Pages 只对「文本类」Content-Type 做 Brotli/Gzip，
# application/octet-stream 不在压缩列表里 → App 拿到原文，不会被 br/gzip。
# 讴歌/影视仓按 body 解析 JSON/TXT，不依赖 Content-Type 头。

/*
  Access-Control-Allow-Origin: *
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff

/*.json
  Content-Type: application/octet-stream
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=300

/sub.txt
  Content-Type: application/octet-stream
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=300

/live-sub.txt
  Content-Type: application/octet-stream
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=300

/live-mini.txt
  Content-Type: application/octet-stream
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=300

/live-lite.txt
  Content-Type: application/octet-stream
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=300

/live-standard.txt
  Content-Type: application/octet-stream
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=300

/live-full.txt
  Content-Type: application/octet-stream
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=300

/live.txt
  Content-Type: application/octet-stream
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=300

# /live.txt 是真正的纯文本直播源（分组,#genre# 格式），
# 不要在 _headers 里覆盖其 Content-Type，保留默认 text/plain
